title: "Detecting unknown arbuscular mycorrhizal fungi from linked long-read rDNA copies: code and data"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "O'Brien"
    given-names: "Aaron"
license: "MIT"
repository-code: "https://github.com/ayobi/amf-novelty-benchmark"
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.23374725"
version: "0.2.0"
date-released: "2026-10-14"
abstract: >-
  Code, curated culture reference and benchmark outputs for naming long-read AMF rDNA copies by MaarjAM
  virtual taxon, UNITE species hypothesis and LSU species clade, and for detecting species absent from the
  references. Tables and other outputs are CC BY 4.0 (DATA_LICENSE.md).
keywords:
  - arbuscular mycorrhizal fungi
  - rDNA
  - long reads
  - metabarcoding
  - novelty detection
